 REMOTE
 Remote needs cloudflared, Cloudflare's tunnel. It is not on this machine.
 Weft can install it:

   brew install cloudflared
   or download it from github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared, with [D].


───────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  [I] INSTALL   [D] DOWNLOAD INSTEAD   [Enter] LOOK AGAIN   [O] TURN OFF   [ESC] CLOSE
 Fab7 says who you are; only this machine says which devices get in.
